	<title id="e00129">Theft-alarm system <image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_123.eps" scale="15" placement="inline"/></title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>opening and closing 
					<indexterm>theft-alarm system</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<p>The system provides an audible alarm and the hazard warning lights blink if triggered. The system is operated in 3 stages.</p>
		<p importance="default">Do not attempt to alter this system or add other devices to it.</p>
